────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  Whose rules guard the agents
  Whose rules guard the agents: the OS sandbox, a container, each AI tool's own, or none at all. A role's own setting
  wins

  ❯ 1. Argonauts Code's (OS sandbox) ✓   Argonauts Code's rules, kept by your OS's own sandbox
    2. Argonauts Code's (container)      Argonauts Code's rules, in a container that holds only the agent's worktree
    3. each AI tool's own                Each AI tool's own sandbox and approvals, with Argonauts Code's off
    4. none                              No protection at all, neither Argonauts Code's nor the tool's

  Enter to choose · ↑↓ to move · type to filter · Esc to close
